## Proposed Changes

### Database Schema (Prisma)

#### [MODIFY] [schema.prisma](file:///d:/inventory%20M-app/server/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Add `userId` field to `Setting`, `Supplier`, `Category`, `Warehouse`, `Product`, `SaleTransaction`, `SupplierInvoice`, `Customer`, `Expense`, `Loan`, and `Staff` models.
- Set up Prisma relation fields referencing the `User` model on each of these models.
- Update unique constraints to be composite per-user (e.g. `@@unique([userId, barcode])` for `Product`, `@@unique([userId, name])` for `Category`, etc.) so that different users can have identical names/barcodes/receipt numbers.

